liam Ford (from Frederick's of Hollywood) doesn't go well.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-08\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Get The Picture\",\"overview\":\"Five models are chosen to be photographed by Mathu Anderson. The agency holds another open casting call which turns out to be a failure.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-08\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"The Axe Falls\",\"overview\":\"In the Season Finale, Janice, Peter, Kodi, Gabe and Duke decide who is going to be cut. The remaining models go to Sunset Boulevard where Janice announces the 16 \\\"management\\\" models and the 8 \\\"new faces\\\" models.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-15\",\"runtime\":60}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2006-06-06\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}